OL,3,GNEWSAMan killed by insurgents gave up
OL,4,Ahelicopter place
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British man killed as he tried to
OL,7,Fflee from a Mozambiquan hotel besieged
OL,8,Fby insurgents had given up his space on
OL,9,Fa rescue helicopter the day before, a
OL,10,Fcoroner said.
OL,12,FPhilip Mawer was working in Palma, in
OL,13,Fthe north of the African country, when
OL,14,FIslamist militants attacked in March
OL,15,F2021.
OL,17,FThe 58-year-old, from Shaftesbury,
OL,18,FDorset, was in a convoy of vehicles
OL,19,Fthat had left the Amarula Hotel over
OL,20,Ffears it would be overrun by the rebel
OL,21,Ffighters.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,335,330,200,160,0,100
