OL,3,GNEWSAMan killed by insurgents gave up
OL,4,Ahelicopter place
OL,5,
OL,6,FHampshire coroner Jason Pegg, who
OL,7,Fconcluded Mawer was unlawfully killed,
OL,8,Fsaid he "gallantly" gave up his space
OL,9,Fon the helicopter, allowing women,
OL,10,Fchildren and the sick to be evacuated
OL,11,Ffirst.
